3. 不属于本仓库的部分 / Not covered by this repository
================================================================================

本 mod 是《杀戮尖塔 2》(Slay the Spire 2) 的非官方粉丝作品，与 Mega Crit 无关，
未获其认可。游戏本体的代码、美术、音频、商标均归 Mega Crit 所有，不在本仓库内，
也不适用上述任何授权。

This is an unofficial fan mod for Slay the Spire 2. It is not affiliated with,
endorsed by, or sponsored by Mega Crit. All Slay the Spire 2 code, art, audio,
and trademarks remain the property of Mega Crit and are neither included in nor
licensed by this repository.

运行本 mod 需要正版《杀戮尖塔 2》以及第三方模组库 BaseLib，两者均按其各自的
授权条款分发。
Running this mod requires a legitimate copy of Slay the Spire 2 and the
third-party mod library BaseLib, each distributed under its own terms.

Spine 运行时 (spine-godot) 不包含在本仓库中，需自行获取；它受 Esoteric Software
的 Spine Runtimes License 约束。
The Spine runtime (spine-godot) is not included in this repository and must be
obtained separately. It is governed by Esoteric Software's Spine Runtimes
License.
